@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Method / document navigation. Scope-independent process/navigation; provider or runner examples are not MVP prerequisites.
 title Resumefolio - Resource evidence and decision review
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #DBEAFE
  BorderColor #94A3B8
  FontColor #17324D
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
  DiamondBorderColor #94A3B8
  StartColor #17324D
  EndColor #17324D
}
start
:Identify capability and constraints;
:Inspect resources and collect evidence;
if (Enough evidence for the dependent decision?) then (yes)
  if (Fits agreed resource, budget and time boundaries?) then (yes)
    :Record justified decision, evidence and limits;
    :Continue only within the agreed phase gates;
  else (conflict)
    :Document conflict, options, costs and impacts;
    :Project owner decides material changes;
    :Update decisions and affected documents;
    :Reassess resources before dependent commitment;
  endif
else (not yet)
  :Record unknowns, owner, next action and review gate;
  :Keep dependent commitment unresolved;
endif
stop
legend bottom
Planning review logic; no server change or technical verification is implied.
Do not silently remove scope or assume additional spending.
endlegend
@enduml
